      "text": "The Council will consist of the Borough Presidents, the City Administrator, the Director of the Budget, the Chief Medical Examiner, the Director of the Office of Civil Defense, the President of the Board of Water Supply, and the heads of the following departments: Air Pollution Control, Buildings, City Planning, Fire, Health, Hospitals, Marine and Aviation, Personnel, Police, Public Works, Purchase, Sanitation, and Water Supply, Gas and Electricity.",
